= Historical Inquiry

We have begun a inquiry into the history of Kaddu and the failures of the previous regimes of Kaddu. Many in the party are asking to propagandize the findings while others ask us to stay true to the facts.

- @restart: Dedice the fate of the inquiry.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@restart
on-arrival: war_guilt += 1

What is the goal of this tribunal?

- @pure_history: To provide a historical record of Kaddu and why the previous itterations of the nation had failed.
- @rewrite: Rewrite the history to slander the opposition and create a cult around the party.

@pure_history
on_arrival: kcp_democracy += 1 

The history is being compiled, as it always has been.

@rewrite
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); kcp_tyrrany += 1; strife += 1

We have begun glorifying the Republic and its creators (us) to the point of Annastasia calling herself the mother of the nation. This radicalizes the opposition.
